From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Tom Plant <tom@tplant.com.au>
Date: Sat, 5 Sep 2026 09:11:33 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] fix(stage3): Disable the cmake debugger

cmake's bundled cppdap uses 1-byte atomics, which riscv64 cannot inline, so
gcc emits calls to __atomic_exchange_1 in libatomic. stage3 never builds
libatomic, so linking cmake fails on riscv64.

Signed-off-by: Tom Plant <tom@tplant.com.au>
---
 packages/bootstrap/stage3/Containerfile | 3 ++-
 1 file changed, 2 insertions(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/packages/bootstrap/stage3/Containerfile b/packages/bootstrap/stage3/Containerfile
index 8e0b2d7a2..917fec2d2 100644
--- a/packages/bootstrap/stage3/Containerfile
+++ b/packages/bootstrap/stage3/Containerfile
@@ -255,7 +255,8 @@ RUN --network=none <<-EOF
 	../configure \
 		--prefix=/usr \
 		-- \
-		-DCMAKE_USE_OPENSSL=OFF
+		-DCMAKE_USE_OPENSSL=OFF \
+		-DCMake_ENABLE_DEBUGGER=OFF
 	make
 	make DESTDIR=/rootfs install
 	rm -rf /cmake-*
